OL,3,GNEWSASection of M25 shut during rush
OL,4,Ahour after crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA section of the M25 in Surrey has
OL,7,Fclosed and will remain shut throughout
OL,8,Fthe busy morning period due to a crash,
OL,9,Fhighway officials say.
OL,11,FThe anti-clockwise section of the
OL,12,Fmotorway is closed between junction 10
OL,13,F(Wisley) and junction 11 (Chertsey)
OL,14,Ffollowing the collision which happened
OL,15,Fjust before midnight.
OL,17,FNational Highways said police had
OL,18,Fcompleted their investigations at the
OL,19,Fscene at about 06:00 BST, but warned
OL,20,Fmotorists to avoid the motorway for
OL,21,Fmost of the morning.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
