OL,3,GNEWSASection of M25 shut during rush
OL,4,Ahour after crash
OL,5,
OL,6,F"The incident scene is now being
OL,7,Fcleared but this is likely to take
OL,8,Fseveral hours and the closure will
OL,9,Fremain through the morning peak travel
OL,10,Fperiod," they said.
